WEBVTT

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:03.716
Americans have always paid
more for their childcare

00:01:03.756 --> 00:01:05.356
than they pay for their mortgage.

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:08.396
It is the largest cost center of families.

00:01:08.716 --> 00:01:12.636
And so when there were no
kind of, available centers of care,

00:01:12.676 --> 00:01:16.276
women, who were already doing
two thirds of the caretaking work,

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.436
had to supplement
basically, their paid labor

00:01:19.436 --> 00:01:20.996
for unpaid labor.

00:01:21.316 --> 00:01:24.476
And you just, again,
saw decades of progress

00:01:24.516 --> 00:01:26.516
just vanish overnight.

00:01:26.556 --> 00:01:28.596
Now, some people thought, well, you know,

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:31.676
once the country gets back up on its feet
and we open things up,